\pard\sa100\f0\fs20\lang1033 Your company uses ComplianceWorks to bring its CAD standards into SOLIDWORKS. Everything is in the \b ComplianceWorks\b0  task pane:\par
\pard\fi-240\li240\sa60\tx240\f0\fs20\lang1033 \bullet\tab \b Design Guidelines\b0  - the company rules for the open part, assembly or drawing. Click a guideline to read it, and tick its box once your model meets it.\par
\pard\fi-240\li240\sa60\tx240\f0\fs20\lang1033 \bullet\tab \b Utilities\b0  - one-click tools such as Quick Check, Generate Quick PDF and Missing References Finder.\par
\pard\fi-240\li240\sa60\tx240\f0\fs20\lang1033 \bullet\tab \b News, Resources and Custom Macros\b0  - updates, links and macros shared by your CAD administrator.\par
